21:30):[/b]<br/><br/>[/quote]<br/><br/>拿关税战对比有点异想天开，一个是单一品种受影响一个是直接全覆盖打击，没什么可慌的", "lou": 21, "content_length": 85, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877420959, "postdatetimestamp": 1785850686}, {"pid": 877422111, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 13, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-04 21:43", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877421891,47288722,188]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=39235785]Doh丶[/uid] (2026-08-04 21:40):[/b]<br/><br/>都知道是嘴炮，可是不跑是傻子[/quote]<br/><br/>都是人精，谁赌你的枪里有没有子弹", "lou": 22, "content_length": 37, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877421891, "postdatetimestamp": 1785850996}, {"pid": 877458626, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 8, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 10:19", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "真让我在新能源赚到钱了，溜了溜了", "lou": 23, "content_length": 32, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1785896345}, {"pid": 877473080, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 11, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 12:09", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "事到如今最后悔的是卖飞了科创[del]还回家吃饭吗[/del][s:ac:哭笑]<br/>按计划半仓躺过这个4-4了，就是手头的沪深300有点拖后腿", "lou": 24, "content_length": 97, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1785902975}, {"pid": 877473969, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 12:17", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877473544,47288722,242]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=38565660]Xcur[/uid] (2026-08-05 12:13):[/b]<br/><br/>P佬现在手里的持仓有哪些呀？ [s:ac:羡慕][/quote]<br/><br/>左1000右300中间夹个有色，其余个股小仓位玩短线治手痒的，比如昨天掏了一波地刺", "lou": 25, "content_length": 80, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877473544, "postdatetimestamp": 1785903472}, {"pid": 877474466, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 2, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 12:23", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877474181,47288722,242]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=41412823]魔法装置爆米花SS[/uid] (2026-08-05 12:20):[/b]<br/><br/>丝袜股份还在吗[s:pg:严肃][/quote]<br/><br/>没了，让我有点失望，来回倒腾就5个点不到", "lou": 26, "content_length": 44, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877474181, "postdatetimestamp": 1785903784}, {"pid": 877475984, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 12:38", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877475676,47288722,243]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=6653387]him1874[/uid] (2026-08-05 12:35):[/b]<br/><br/>地 刺 能 赚 钱 ？！！！[/quote]<br/><br/>昨天十字星加阳线，又是底分型，墨提斯看见手痒了", "lou": 27, "content_length": 51, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877475676, "postdatetimestamp": 1785904709}, {"pid": 877476265, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 14, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 12:41", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877473373,47288722,242]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=60621194]HoshiZorA_Z[/uid] (2026-08-05 12:12):[/b]<br/><br/>冷知识，很多人炒股一天亏的钱能去商K喝到吐，能泡脚泡到脚浮肿，能点小妹点到&amp;#128046;子抽筋，能吃各种好吃的吃胖几十斤[s:ac:哭笑]<br/>但是大家还是爱玩全国最热门手游[/quote]<br/><br/>证银出来消费也消费了，体重也胖了，小妹也点到眼盲了，你猜怎么着<br/>诶我还踩点回来吃反弹", "lou": 28, "content_length": 87, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877473373, "postdatetimestamp": 1785904884}, {"pid": 877487971, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 32, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 14:37", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "就我以前纯韭的视角来看，应该还有一个不敢追的人看了后面的盘面后心想我就知道是骗炮诱多还好没进的阶段", "lou": 29, "content_length": 98, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1785911879}, {"pid": 877488264, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 27, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 14:40", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877488047,47288722,267]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-05 14:38):[/b]<br/><br/>然后下一步是什么剧情 细说[/quote]<br/><br/>“艹，好像是真的”<br/>“忍不住了，干了”<br/>“我怎么站岗了，xx老师，这个位置拿住能解套吗”", "lou": 30, "content_length": 87, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877488047, "postdatetimestamp": 1785912042}, {"pid": 877490859, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 6, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 15:04", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877488928,47288722,270]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=65329649]zippo578[/uid] (2026-08-05 14:47):[/b]<br/><br/>收上3876的话，就代表4-4已经走13天了[s:pg:哭][/quote]<br/><br/>我倒觉得我30号入场那天才开始算4-4", "lou": 31, "content_length": 38, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877488928, "postdatetimestamp": 1785913467}, {"pid": 877496643, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 15, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 15:53", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877495394,47288722,279]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67145444]sentser[/uid] (2026-08-05 15:43):[/b]<br/><br/>我判断有个超级低位，大家都不敢进的地方，没错，就是三擒p指导的新能源，海指导也买了宁德时代[s:ac:茶][s:ac:茶][s:ac:茶]，等3742我去买点电池玩玩[/quote]<br/><br/>我在新能源报仇了，望周知", "lou": 32, "content_length": 29, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877495394, "postdatetimestamp": 1785916422}, {"pid": 877497335, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 0, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 15:59", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877496886,47288722,281]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-05 15:55):[/b]<br/><br/>输三次 赢一次就报仇了吗？<br/><br/>再进三次 起码要4比3才能算赢[s:ac:哭笑][/quote]<br/><br/>忘了以前进几次了，反正这次把6月那会小亏跑路的都挣回来了", "lou": 33, "content_length": 60, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877496886, "postdatetimestamp": 1785916771}, {"pid": 877497976, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 3, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 16:05", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877497615,47288722,282]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=34093211]CANORs[/uid] (2026-08-05 16:02):[/b]<br/><br/>看到p佬点的，但还是没勇气跟，对新韭菜而言太伤了那波[/quote]<br/><br/>也不敢让你们跟，我抱着送人头的想法进去的，一方面是节奏太顺了想找点挫折压一压情绪，另一方面是一直观测的hkxy走的挺好的，感觉是有资金在做", "lou": 34, "content_length": 139, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877497615, "postdatetimestamp": 1785917120}, {"pid": 877507551, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-05 17:28", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877505114,47288722,288]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67143809]Rzzz二号机[/uid] (2026-08-05 17:07):[/b]<br/><br/>不对啊 哥? 不是-4-4吗 怎么又ABC C杀了?[s:pg:哭][/quote]<br/><br/>昨天还回复我呢今天就忘了讲的什么了是吧", "lou": 35, "content_length": 43, "from_client": "8 Android", "reply_to": 877505114, "postdatetimestamp": 1785922092}, {"pid": 877540678, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 35, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-06 00:08", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "[E1785946441 0 0]\t", "content": "看你们聊的4-4有点没绷住，只要后面不再破平台，7.30就是4-3阶段的底部筑底二踩，3天站上5日线是右侧确认4-4信号，右侧意味着已经走了几天了<br/>我认为我是对的", "lou": 36, "content_length": 145, "from_client": "8 Android", "postdatetimestamp": 1785946129}, {"pid": 877563085, "fid": 510567, "tid": 47288722, "authorid": 67145714, "type": 0, "score": 7, "score_2": 0, "recommend": 0, "postdate": "2026-08-06 10:03", "subject": "", "alterinfo": "", "content": "[quote][pid=877544866,47288722,304]Reply[/pid] [b]Post by [uid=67208424]tpx10086[/uid] (2026-08-06 01:45):[/b]<br/><br/>p佬，这个位置有没有可能开启大五浪，上证整个下跌趋势中站上过五日线，但是没能突破下跌趋势又砸回来了，基本上都是被十日线压制住了，今天放量站上十日线，是不是可以看作突破规律的第一根，那后续是走B反接C杀，还是直接大五，现在的走势能确定吗？[/quote]<br/><br/>二浪走了4-6个月，你幻想就这么快结束四浪？", "lou": 37, "content_length": 46, "from_client": "8 Android", "rep